   "text": "HEALING IS A PROCESS THAT IS NOT LINEAR, AND IT IS OKAY TO GO AT YOUR OWN PACE. YOU ARE NOT EXPECTED TO MOVE ON QUICKLY, AND IT IS IMPORTANT TO GIVE YOURSELF TIME TO PROCESS YOUR FEELINGS. THE LOSS OF A FRIEND IS A TRULY SAD EXPERIENCE, AND IT IS NOT REASONABLE TO FEEL GUILTY OR RESPONSIBLE FOR WHAT HAPPENED.  \n\nI REMEMBER A TIME WHEN I LOST A CLOSE FRIEND, AND IT WAS A VERY DIFFICULT PERIOD. WE BOTH GOING THROUGH A LOT, AND IT FEELLED LIKE THE WORLD HAD CHANGED IN A WAY THAT WAS HARD TO UNDERSTAND. BUT THROUGH THE PAIN, WE FOUND STRENGTH IN EACH OTHER, AND THAT CONNECTION HELPED US MOVE FORWARD.  \n\nIF YOU WOULD LIKE, I CAN SHARE A STORY OR OFFER SOME COMFORTING WORDS. YOU ARE NOT ALONE IN THIS, AND I AM HERE TO HELP YOU THROUGH THIS DIFFICULT TIME.",
